@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div style="max-width: 760px;">
    <h1 class="h2 mb-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted small">Last updated: April 29, 2026</p>

    <p>Your privacy matters to us. This policy explains what information Leadership Helper collects, how it is used, and where it is stored.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect only the minimum information required to provide the service:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Email address</strong> — used to verify your identity via a one-time code. We do not share your email with any third party.</li>
        <li><strong>Display name</strong> — an optional name you choose. It is shown only as the author of situations you create.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage data</strong> — the situations you save, experiences you start, and reflection notes you write. This content is private to your account and is never shared with other users or third parties.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>Your information is used solely to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Authenticate you and maintain your session.</li>
        <li>Store and retrieve your personal experiences and saved situations.</li>
        <li>Allow you to optionally publish situations to the community browse list.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not use your data for advertising, profiling, or any purpose beyond operating the application.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">3. Data Storage and Location</h2>
    <p>All data collected by Leadership Helper is stored exclusively on a <strong>private server located in Canada</strong>. We do not use third-party cloud databases or data brokers. Your data never leaves Canadian jurisdiction and is subject to Canadian privacy law, including the <em>Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act</em> (PIPEDA).</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>We take reasonable technical measures to protect your information, including:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>HTTPS encryption for all data in transit.</li>
        <li>One-time login codes that expire after 60 minutes — we never store your password.</li>
        <li>Session cookies that are HTTP-only and expire after 30 days of inactivity.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">5. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>Your data is retained for as long as your account is active. You may request deletion of your account and all associated data at any time by contacting us.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">6. Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use a single session cookie to keep you signed in. We do not use tracking cookies, analytics cookies, or any third-party cookies.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">7. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Under PIPEDA you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Access the personal information we hold about you.</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate information.</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us directly.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent revision. Continued use of the service after any changes constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
</div>
